PROSE:
The party catches their breath on a high ridge after tumbling through the firewall out of the collapsing frontier zone, spilling onto the cold paved stone of the outskirts. Rhea hit the ground hard, her lungs burning as she dragged in air that tasted of ozone and polished concrete. Behind them, a massive wall of raw, red deletion code swept across the landscape, cleanly erasing the petrified trees, the ruined tollbooth, and the administrative sanctum. The frontier zone simply ceased to exist.

[Status Alert: Stamina is currently 0/150.]
[Status Effect: Exhaustion (Severe) remains active.]

Rhea forced herself up onto her elbows, her singed arm hair scraping against the stone. To her left, Vance was on his hands and knees, coughing violently. His blistered hands maintained a death grip on his bent rebar. 

"Durability is sitting at fifty-two percent," Vance grunted, eyeing the warped iron. 

[Vance Harrow - Status Check]
[Active Effect: Heavy Blunt-Force Trauma.]

Nearby, Unit 734 let out a pathetic buzz. Plumes of acrid black smoke vented from its damaged frame. 

[Diagnostic: Unit 734]
[Chassis Integrity: 28%]
[Status: Critical System Failure Imminent.]

"The Civic Layer," the drone synthesized, its optical lens flickering toward the valley below. "Population: Unquantifiable. Threat Level: Absolute."

Rhea pushed herself into a sitting position and looked over the edge of the ridge. The city below was an impossible, sprawling monolith of black glass and polished steel, laced with massive conduits of glowing blue data. It was an endless, grinding bureaucracy made physical. 

Her right hand was clamped tightly around the Administrative Residue Token. The heavy, illicit access key pulsed with a slow blue light, harmonizing with the data streams below. She had zero stamina, but she had the proof of the skim, the Mercy Cache coordinates safely stowed in her left blazer pocket, and a severed piece of the overseer's authority. 

The token suddenly flared. The physical weight of the item vanished, dissolving into a stream of pure light that sank directly into her palm, bypassing her physical stats and interfacing with her character continuity state. The air in front of her shattered into a massive, gold-framed system window. 

[System Prompt]
[Entity Migration Detected. Origin: Deleted Node. Destination: Civic Layer.]

[Token Registration]
[Administrative Residue Token (Illicit) recognized. Access privileges temporarily granted under Clause 44-B (Disputed Authority).]

[Civic Layer Welcome]
[Welcome to the Civic Layer, Auditor. Your presence is highly irregular. Your survival is statistically anomalous. Your impending bankruptcy is guaranteed.]

